{"type": "gold", "license": "lecturer-provided", "psa_class": "PSA", "lecturer_id": "1268", "dholuo": "Kaka inyalo medo teko mar geng'o tuo mar COVID-19;
1. Bed gi pi moromo - metho lita 3-4 mag pi pile ka pile.
2. Kaw chiemo ma nigi antioxidant mang'eny - amla, guava, alode ma nigi oboke, spinach, garlic, green tea, peppers, turmeric
3. Timo gik matego del
4. Paro matut
5. Nindo e yor chuny", "somali": "Sida loo xoojiyo nidaamka difaaca jirka ee ka dhanka ah COVID-19; 1. Noqo mid qoyan - cab 3-4 litir oo biyo ah maalin kasta. 2. Qaado cunto antioxidant hodan ah - amla, guava, khudradda caleemaha cagaaran, spinach, basasha, shaaha cagaaran, qumbaha, 3. Jimicsi 4. Fadhiga 5. Hurdo tayo leh"}
